WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.816
Hi! Today is about countries and languages.

2
00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:12.960
Where are you from? Where do you live? What do you speak?

3
00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:17.603
Here are a few countries:

4
00:00:18.003 --> 00:00:20.291
Colombia

5
00:00:20.691 --> 00:00:22.787
Mexico

6
00:00:23.187 --> 00:00:25.259
Spain

7
00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:27.803
Germany

8
00:00:28.203 --> 00:00:30.275
Austria

9
00:00:30.675 --> 00:00:32.843
Switzerland

10
00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:38.453
Where are you from? Listen:

11
00:00:38.853 --> 00:00:41.405
I'm from Peru.

12
00:00:41.805 --> 00:00:47.597
Ich komme aus… that's my country. And where do I live?

13
00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:50.525
I live in Berlin.

14
00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:54.605
Ich wohne in… that's my city.

15
00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.844
Now the verb wohnen (to live). Listen:

16
00:01:01.244 --> 00:01:04.228
We live in Bogotá.

17
00:01:04.628 --> 00:01:07.180
Look at the ending:

18
00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.652
I live

19
00:01:10.052 --> 00:01:12.124
you live

20
00:01:12.524 --> 00:01:15.412
he lives, she lives

21
00:01:15.812 --> 00:01:17.980
we live

22
00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:25.147
The verb sprechen (to speak) is special. With ich we say:

23
00:01:25.547 --> 00:01:28.171
I speak Spanish.

24
00:01:28.571 --> 00:01:31.531
But with du the e becomes i:

25
00:01:31.931 --> 00:01:34.291
You speak German.

26
00:01:34.691 --> 00:01:38.515
And also: he speaks, she speaks.

27
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.032
Listen: Sofía and Jonas are in German class.

28
00:01:45.432 --> 00:01:48.704
Where are you from, Sofía?

29
00:01:49.104 --> 00:01:51.968
I'm from Mexico.

30
00:01:52.368 --> 00:01:54.800
And where do you live?

31
00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.968
I live in Hamburg.

32
00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:01.424
Which languages do you speak?

33
00:02:01.824 --> 00:02:04.616
Spanish and English.

34
00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:14.564
Now you! Where are you from? Where do you live? Which languages do you speak?

35
00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:27.403
Great! Now you can:

36
00:02:27.803 --> 00:02:33.739
You say where you're from, where you live and which languages you speak.

37
00:02:34.139 --> 00:02:36.259
See you soon!
